        "created_at": "2015-09-03T04:55:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I was derping around the other day and started wondering, \"Who would voice the sentinels characters in an animated series?\" Any ideas? Here are some I came up with</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Legacy- Tim Daly (points to anyone who gets why)</p><p>The Wraith- Tara Strong</p><p>Absolute Zero- Nolan North</p><p>Chrono Ranger- Ron Perlman</p><p>Unity- Monica Rial</p><p>Gloomweaver- John Hurt</p>",
