        "created_at": "2015-09-03T15:59:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I want Nathon Fillion as somebody. Maybe Guise. I bet everybody has a voice simmilar to deadpool for him but i think that a high pitch annoying vice would be to cliche. OOH and Alan Tudyk as WAGER MASTER. And if we ever get a Live-Action Wraith, I want Summer Glau...for the role...</p><p>For Ra i want Daniel Flynn...actually mabye just for Dr. Wahington...actaully ignore this one...</p><p>Yuri Lowenthal as Setback.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
